WEBVTT

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.474
AI tools can help us work faster.

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:13.322
They can summarize documents, rewrite emails, analyze data, generate ideas, and even help with code.

00:00:13.322 --> 00:00:20.245
But sometimes, in the rush to get work done, we may not stop to ask: What am I actually sharing with this AI tool?

00:00:20.445 --> 00:00:22.199
It might seem harmless.

00:00:22.399 --> 00:00:24.594
You upload a report to get a quick summary.

00:00:24.594 --> 00:00:29.675
You paste a draft customer response and ask AI to rewrite the message in a more professional tone.

00:00:29.675 --> 00:00:32.671
You use an AI extension to summarize a webpage.

00:00:32.671 --> 00:00:36.667
Each action may seem small: just a quick shortcut to save time.

00:00:36.667 --> 00:00:39.113
You try a free AI app to take meeting notes.

00:00:39.113 --> 00:00:45.330
But if the tool is not approved for work use, sensitive information can leave the organization’s control.

00:00:45.330 --> 00:00:49.598
When sensitive data enters a public or unauthorized AI tool, it can

00:00:49.598 --> 00:00:54.323
be difficult to know where it goes, how long it is kept, or who can access it.

00:00:54.323 --> 00:00:58.565
A customer record, internal report, or source code file entered into

00:00:58.565 --> 00:01:03.320
the wrong AI tool can become an incident the organization has to investigate.

00:01:03.320 --> 00:01:10.639
[Before entering data into AI, ask yourself]: Would I be comfortable sending this information outside the organization?

00:01:10.639 --> 00:01:14.149
If the answer is no, do not enter it into any tool.

00:01:14.149 --> 00:01:16.687
This is where Shadow AI becomes a risk.

00:01:16.687 --> 00:01:22.796
Shadow AI happens when employees use tools that have not been approved by the organization.

00:01:22.996 --> 00:01:25.027
These tools may look helpful.

00:01:25.227 --> 00:01:28.595
They promise faster writing, smarter search, or coding support.

00:01:28.595 --> 00:01:35.848
But if they have not been reviewed, the organization cannot confirm how they handle data or whether the tool is secure.

00:01:35.848 --> 00:01:39.545
AI browser extensions and plugins can be especially risky.

00:01:39.545 --> 00:01:43.685
Some ask for broad access to your browser, emails, and cloud files.

00:01:43.685 --> 00:01:49.484
That means a tool designed to help you work faster could also view sensitive information displayed in your browser.

00:01:49.484 --> 00:01:54.499
Only use AI extensions, plugins, and connected apps that are approved for work use.

00:01:54.499 --> 00:02:00.207
Before you upload, paste, connect, or install anything, pause and check.

00:02:00.207 --> 00:02:02.297
Remove sensitive details where possible.

00:02:02.297 --> 00:02:04.967
Do not upload confidential documents to public tools.

00:02:05.167 --> 00:02:07.060
Be careful with extensions.

00:02:07.260 --> 00:02:10.639
And never share passwords or digital access keys.

00:02:10.639 --> 00:02:14.019
If you are unsure, stop and ask before proceeding.

00:02:14.019 --> 00:02:16.829
AI can be powerful, but it must be used safely.

00:02:17.029 --> 00:02:19.155
The goal is not to avoid AI.

00:02:19.555 --> 00:02:22.126
The goal is to use it responsibly.
